            </note>
            <note corresp="#d882-f2" n="2" xml:id="d882-f2-content">
                <p>Despatch 13, September 4, from Seoul, transmitted an exchange of letters of
                    September 1 between Maj. Gen. John B. Coulter, Commander of USAFIK, and President Rhee for transfer of the
                    national police to the Republic of Korea on September 3 (895.105/9–448).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
